-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Both kidneys are normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>or cystic lesion, no renal calculi or hydronephrotic\r\nchanges seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm. (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm. (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>RIGHT KIDNEYS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right kidney is normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>or cystic lesion, no renal calculi or hydronephrotic\r\nchanges seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm. (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>LEFT KIDNEYS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right kidney is normal in size, shape, outline and\r\nposition. Renal cortical echotexture is normal with preserved cortico-medullary\r\necho differentiation. There is no evidence of any solid <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>or cystic lesion, no renal calculi or hydronephrotic\r\nchanges seen. Perirenal spaces are clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left Kidney measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm. (approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URETERS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Not dilated hence not visualized.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>URINARY BLADDER<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Prevoid: Shows normal distension. Bladder walls are\r\nregular. No Calculus \/ Growth \/ Sludge <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>etc are seen in the walls or lumen. Prevoid urinary\r\nbladder volume is\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ml (approx.) <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>POSTVOID:<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>-\u00a0 <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Post void residual urinary bladder volume is\r\nincreased \/ insignificant\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 ml (approx)].<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>UTERUS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:- <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Anteverted. Normal in shape and outline. The size is\r\nwithin normal limits<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm.\r\nMyometrium:- Normal homogenous appearance. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No myomatous lesion is seen. Endometrium:- Normal in\r\nthickness\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm.] <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>and brightness. The cavity is empty. Cervix and\r\nvagina appears normal.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ADNEXA<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: -<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>The fallopian tubes are not dilated. Both ovaries\r\nare normal in size and echopattern.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No ovarian or adnexal SOL seen. Capsular outline is\r\npreserved. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Right ovary measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm.\r\n(approx). <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Left ovary measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 cm\r\n(approx).<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>POUCH OF DOUGLAS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'> <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Clear. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>PROSTATE<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>:-<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>prostate is normal in size,\u00a0 outline and echotexture\r\nappear normal. No focal lesion is seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>Prostate measures:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 x\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\r\ncm. approx. weight:\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 grams.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>MISCELLANEOUS<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: -<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No free fluid is seen in peritoneal cavity \/ either\r\npleural space. No retroperitoneal abnormality<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>is seen. Aorta and IVC appears normal. No enlarged\r\npara-aortic lymphnodes seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>ILIAC FOSSAE<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: -<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No definite abnormality seen. Bilateral psoas\r\nshadows are normal. <\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No obvious collection \/ SOL seen.<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;\r\nfont-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>IMPRESSION<\/span><\/u><\/b><b><span\r\nlang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>: <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNoSpacing><b><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>No Significant Abnormality is seen in USG\r\nscanning of KUB. <\/span><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><i><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:11.0pt;font-family:\r\n\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/i><\/p>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal align=center style='text-align:center'><span lang=EN-US\r\nstyle='font-size:12.0pt;font-family:\"Courier New\"'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/p>\r\n\r\n<\/div>","page":{"size":"595.45pt 841.7pt","margin":"134.7pt 36.0pt 72.0pt 36.0pt"}}